
TASK 3 – DYNAMIC PROGRAMMING: 0/1 KNAPSACK (9 Marks)
Objective: Design a Dynamic Programming algorithm to maximise the total value of indivisible items without exceeding the vehicle's carrying capacity.

Unlike the Fractional Knapsack Problem, items in the 0/1 Knapsack Problem cannot be divided. Each item must either be selected completely (1) or rejected (0).

